# DualShock 4 Controller Button List
# name        id    type     bitmask    axis_min axis_max  binded to

CROSS         0     button   0x0001     -         -         KB_ENTER
CIRCLE        1     button   0x0002     -         -         KB_b
SQUARE        2     button   0x0004     -         -         KB_x
TRIANGLE      3     button   0x0008     -         -         KB_y

L1            4     button   0x0010     -         -         default
R1            5     button   0x0020     -         -         default

SHARE         6     button   0x0040     -         -         default
OPTIONS       7     button   0x0080     -         -         default
PS            8     button   0x0100     -         -         default

L3            9     button   0x0200     -         -         default
R3           10     button   0x0400     -         -         default

DPAD_UP      11     button   0x0800     -         -         default
DPAD_DOWN    12     button   0x1000     -         -         default
DPAD_LEFT    13     button   0x2000     -         -         default
DPAD_RIGHT   14     button   0x4000     -         -         default

L2           15     axis     -          0         32767     default
R2           16     axis     -          0         32767     default

LSTICK_X     17     axis     -         -32768     32767     default
LSTICK_Y     18     axis     -         -32768     32767     default
RSTICK_X     19     axis     -         -32768     32767     default
RSTICK_Y     20     axis     -         -32768     32767     default

TOUCHPAD     21     button   0x8000     -         -         default
BACK_PADDLE_L  22     button   0x10000    -         -         default
BACK_PADDLE_R  23     button   0x20000    -         -         default